  "short_id": "ep072",
  "title": "How Does Your Brain Talk to Your Body? 🧠 Nerves & Senses for Kids",
  "cover_text": "BRAIN MAIL!",
  "description": "Meet your brain, follow its super-fast nerve messages, and find out how your five senses work! Leo asks, big sister Mia explains, with reflexes and a quiz at the end.\n\nWant the 60-second version? It's on our Shorts tab.\n\nThe CurioKids Club: curious answers to kids' big questions. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@CurioKidsClub",
  "hashtags": [
